FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

FR-01: Upload Post
User story: US-S-01
Acceptance Criteria: 
The upload form must validate all required fields before submission. If invalid, an error message is displayed.
If the file is over 10MB, the system must automatically compress and resize the file before uploading.
Upon successful upload, the post must be added to the library, and the user should receive a success notification.

FR-02: Search Topics
User story: US-S-02
Acceptance Criteria: 
The search bar must allow input of tags.
The system must validate the tag. If the tag does not exist, an error message is displayed.
If the tag is valid, the system displays a list of all posts associated with that tag.

FR-03: Download Posts
User story: US-S-03.
Acceptance Criteria: 
The user must select a valid post first.
The download action must trigger a standard file download to the user's device.

FR-04: Rate Posts
User story: US-S-04
Acceptance Criteria: 
The user must select a valid post first.
The system must allow the user to submit a rating
The rating must be saved to the database and reflected in the post's average score.

FR-05: Access Library
User story: US-S-05
Acceptance Criteria: 
The user must be successfully authenticated (logged in) to access the library.
Once accessed, the user must be presented with the available actions (Search, Select, Rate, Download).

FR-06: Create Tag
User story: US-A-01
Acceptance Criteria: 
The Admin enters a new tag name.
The system checks if the tag already exists.
If it does exist, an error code is displayed.
If it does not exist, the new tag is saved to the database.

FR-07: Review Posts
User story: US-A-02
Acceptance Criteria: 
The Admin reviews the content of a newly uploaded post.
The Admin chooses to "Accept" or "Deny". 
If accepted, the post is sent to the library.
If denied, the post is marked as "Post denied" and is not visible to standard users.

FR-08: Ban User
User story: US-A-03
Acceptance Criteria: 
The Admin investigates a "Problem with User" report.
The Admin confirms the user violated the TOS.
The system flags the user as "Banned".
The database is updated, and the user immediately loses access to the platform.

FR-09: Unban User
User story: US-A-04
Acceptance Criteria: 
The Admin reviews a "Ban Appeal" from a banned user.
The Admin confirms the appeal is valid.
The system flags the user as "Unbanned".
The database is updated, and the user's access is restored.

FR-10: Approve New Accounts
User story: US-A-05
Acceptance Criteria: 
The Admin reviews a pending "New Account" request.
If the account is accepted, the user is added to the database.
If the account is denied, the user receives a "User denied" notification and is not granted access.

FR-11: User Authentication
User story: US-U-01
Acceptance Criteria: 
The system must validate user credentials (username and password).
If authentication succeeds, the user is granted access to the main library.
If authentication fails, the user is denied access and an error message is displayed.
